Now we start with the following observation.  $\rule{25cm}{3.5pt}$  $\textbf{\text{Edge manipulation.}}$  Let  $v_1 - v_2$  be an edge. When we add  $1$  to the value of  $v_1$  and substract  $1$  from the value of  $v_2$ , only two faces get affected. See the picture.
