We wish to show the following quantity is real:  $$ \left( \frac{u-a}{u-m} \right) \div \left( \frac{t-a}{t-m} \right) = \frac{u-a}{u-m} \cdot \frac{t-m}{t-a}  $$    $$ = \frac{a+b+p-ab\overline{p}-2a}{a+b+p-ab\overline{p}-a-d} \cdot \frac{2  \frac{cd-ab}{c+d-a-b}-(a+d)}{2 \frac{cd-ab}{c+d-a-b} -2a}  $$    $$ = \frac{b-a+\frac{ac(b+d)-bd(a+c)}{ac-bd}-ab\frac{b+d-a-c}{bd-ac}}{b-d+\frac{ac(b+d)-bd(a+c)}{ac-bd}-ab\frac{b+d-a-c}{bd-ac}} \cdot \frac{2(cd-ab)-(a+d)(c+d-a-b)}{2(cd-ab-a(c+d-a-b))} $$    $$ = \frac{(b-a)(ac-bd)+ac(b+d)-bd(a+c)+ab(b+d-a-c)}{(b-d)(ac-bd)+ac(b+d)-bd(a+c)+ab(b+d-a-c)} \cdot \frac{2cd-2ab- \left( ac+ad-a^2-ab+cd+d^2-ad-bd \right) }{cd-ab-ac-ad+a^2+ab} $$    $$ = \frac{abd-b^2d-a^2c+abd+acd-bcd+ab^2-a^2b}{abd-b^2+bd^2-bcd+ab^2-a^2b} \cdot \frac{cd-ab-ac+a^2-d^2+bd}{cd-ac-ad+a^2} $$    $$ = \frac{(a-b)(-ac+bd+cd-ab)}{b(a-d)(b+c-a-d)} \cdot \frac{((d-a)(c+b-a-d)}{(d-a)(c-a)} $$    $$ =\frac{(a-b)(d-a)(b+c)}{b(a-d)} \cdot \frac{1}{c-a} = \frac{(b+c)(b-a)}{b(c-a)} $$  The conjugate of this is   $$ \frac{(\tfrac{1}{b}+\tfrac{1}{c})(\tfrac{1}{b}-\tfrac{1}{a})}{\tfrac{1}{b} \left( \tfrac{1}{c}-\tfrac{1}{a} \right)}  = \frac{(b+c)(a-b)}{b(a-c)} $$   as desired.</details>

