 $\color{blue} \textbf{\text{Answer.}}$   $\boxed{\text{Every } N\geq 2.}$  $\color{blue} \textbf{\text{Solution.}}$ Obviously,  $N=1$  does not work.
We claim that every  $N\geq 2$  works, by induction. 

Base case  $N=2$ . Consider the following construction.
[asy]
