We claim that the answer is all even integers. This may be achieved by  $(x,y,z)=(1,x,1)$ . Let  $s=\text{lcm}(x,y,z)$ ,  $a = \frac{s}{\text{lcm}(x,y)}$ ,  $b = \frac{s}{\text{lcm}(y,z)}$ , and  $c = \frac{s}{\text{lcm}(x,z)}$ . Then, the expression becomes
