Feels like overkill but couldn't resist myself not doing this after 2012 C1.**Part a.** Denote the height of  $i^{\text{th}}$  book by  $\mathcal H(i)$  similarly define  $\mathcal W(i)$ . Consider the quantity  $\sum_{i=1}^n i \mathcal H(i)$ . 
\begin{align*}
\text{Sum before moving book j and j+1} &= \sum_{i=1 \neq \{j,j+1\}}^n i \mathcal H(i) + j \mathcal H(j) + (j+1)\mathcal H(j+1)
&= \sum_{i=1 \neq \{j,j+1\}}^n i \mathcal H(i)+ j[\mathcal H(j) + \mathcal H(j+1)] + \mathcal H(j+1) 
