The coefficient of  $t^2$  is
\begin{align*}
&\quad\ \,a^2S_A\left(S_A(2S^2-c^2S_C)+S_B(2S^2-b^2c^2)\right)-b^2S_B\left(-S_A(2S^2-a^2c^2)-S_B(2S^2-c^2S_C)\right)+S_C\left((2S^2-a^2c^2)(b^2c^2-2S^2)+(2S^2-c^2S_C)^2\right)
