Note: Eight semi-corners are found at the junction between the (top-right corner of the top-left  $n = 2^{k-1}$  config) and (top-left corner of the top-right  $n = 2^{k-1}$  config); and so on.  $\color{green} \rule{25cm}{2pt}$   $\color{red} \text{Section 2: Anti-Construction, Cluster Style.}$  
